  "details": "VRChat Version:\nVRChat 2021.2.1\nDescription of the bug:\nWhen there is only one person in an instance, the physical material or rigid body behaves incorrectly.\nAs an example, a ball hit in the world of YAKYUBAN (baseball) does not fly correctly when alone. (It doesn't increase the distance, and it doesn't roll when you hit a falling ball.)\nIt works correctly when there is more than one person in the instance.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\nCompare the case where batting is done in this world with one person in the instance and the case where batting is done with multiple people in the instance.\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_f98e3979-d9d6-4764-b9a4-e5dbcedc83d5",
